@host = http://localhost:5080

### API budget
GET {{host}}/api/data/budget

### Add known weekly expiry when needed
POST {{host}}/api/data/expiry?expiryDate=2026-09-29

### Ensure any historical strike exists in PostgreSQL
POST {{host}}/api/data/ensure-contract?date=2026-09-25&expiryDate=2026-09-29&strike=23100&optionType=CE&liveMode=false

### Read candle data
GET {{host}}/api/data/candles?date=2026-09-25&expiryDate=2026-09-29&strike=23100&optionType=CE&liveMode=false

### Start single-day replay
POST {{host}}/api/backtest/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-09-25",
  "expiryDate": "2026-09-29",
  "hedgeDistance": 300
}

### Multi-day backtest
POST {{host}}/api/backtest/range
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromDate": "2026-09-01",
  "toDate": "2026-09-30",
  "hedgeDistance": 300
}

### Start paper live mode
POST {{host}}/api/live/start?hedgeDistance=300&executeBrokerOrders=false

### Live status
GET {{host}}/api/live/status

### Stop live
POST {{host}}/api/live/stop
